    "content": "<p style=\"text-align:start\">[Security]<br /> &middot;Added the June 2020 Android security patch to enhance system security.<br /> &middot; You can now lock an app clone using the &quot;App lock&quot; feature.</p>  <p style=\"text-align:start\">&nbsp;</p>  <p style=\"text-align:start\">[System]<br /> &middot; Improved system performance and stability.<br /> &middot; Optimised power consumption to extend battery life.<br /> &middot; Optimised the accidental touch feature for &quot;Swipe gestures from both sides&quot; and &quot;Swipe-up gestures&quot;: In the landscape mode, swipe once to go back while you are watching a video, and swipe twice to go back while you are playing a game.</p>  <p style=\"text-align:start\">&nbsp;</p>  <p style=\"text-align:start\">[Communications]<br /> &middot; Optimised network and phone call performance.</p>",
