    "status": true,
    "releaseDate": "2020-05-17 18:14:00",
    "content": "<p>[Security]<br /> &bull; Added the May 2020 Android security patch to enhance system security.</p>  <p>[System]<br /> &bull; Improved system performance and stability.<br /> &bull; Improved touch sensitivity of the screen.<br /> &bull; Fixed an issue where auto-scroll of the phone screen would become slow when you captured a long screenshot.</p>  <p>[Communications]<br /> &bull; Optimised network and phone call performance.<br /> &bull; Fixed several Wi-Fi connection issues and optimised Wi-Fi performance.</p>  <p>[Camera]<br /> &bull; Improved camera effects and user experience.</p>",
